<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48376" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερᾰπ-ευτέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must do service to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.1.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must court, flatter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀκούοντας ἐπαίνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.Al.</u>
					1436b32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one must cultivate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν
			γῆν</span> X.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must treat medically</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				408b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.101
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>one must prepare</i> fat, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.76
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεραπευτέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>to
				be courted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				38
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
